    "description": "Visitors' camp, level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. A traveller's camp (21 x 14) grouped round an unlit fire in a stone ring on a trodden earth patch with log seats: two clean green A-frame tents (ridge pole, corner poles, trim along the bottom edge, bedrolls inside) face the fire from either side; a canopy bed, a woodpile and the supplies along the back; a cart, a camp table and a hitching rail along the front. Level 2 a covered wagon, a cooking spit and pot, pennants, rugs and lanterns; level 3 a red and white market awning over the supplies, a welcome sign, cushions and flowers. Not yet builder-tested: azure_bluet, cauldron, cornflower, dandelion, fern, oak_sign, oxeye_daisy, red_banner, red_wool, short_grass, white_wool. Decoration step adds: potted_plant, sign_text.",
